    <string name="ex_1_title">Butterfly Pelvic Flow (Baddha Konasana)</string>
    <string name="ex_1_desc">Relieves menstrual tension, opens hip flexors, and boosts pelvic circulation. Hold for 3 minutes with slow belly breaths.</string>
    <string name="ex_2_title">Chest &amp; Posture Pectoral Lift</string>
    <string name="ex_2_desc">Strengthens pectoral muscles supporting breast tissue and relieves upper back strain. 3 sets of 15 slow repetitions.</string>
    <string name="ex_3_title">Rhythmic Kegel Core Strengthening</string>
    <string name="ex_3_desc">Lift and hold pelvic floor muscles for 5 seconds, then relax for 5 seconds. Repeat 12 times while breathing naturally.</string>
    <string name="ex_4_title">Cat-Cow Spinal Wave (Marjaryasana)</string>
    <string name="ex_4_desc">Soothes lower back cramps and balances nervous system tension. 10 slow breath-synchronized rounds.</string>

    <!-- Module 5: Adult Wellness (18+ Lock) -->
    <string name="mod_adult_title">Adult Wellness (18+ Lock)</string>
    <string name="mod_adult_subtitle">Protected educational reproductive health guide</string>
    <string name="adult_lock_heading">18+ Age Verification &amp; Privacy Gate</string>
    <string name="adult_lock_desc">This section contains strictly educational medical information on intimate health, pelvic wellness, and reproductive care. No explicit images are included. Confirm you are 18+ or enter PIN (1818) to unlock.</string>
    <string name="adult_pin_label">Enter 4-Digit Privacy PIN (Default: 1818)</string>
    <string name="adult_btn_unlock">I am 18+ • Unlock Educational Guide</string>
    <string name="adult_btn_lock">Lock 18+ Section Now</string>
    <string name="adult_pin_error">Please enter the valid 4-digit PIN (1818) to unlock.</string>
    <string name="adult_topic1_title">Intimate pH &amp; Microbiome Balance</string>
    <string name="adult_topic1_body">A healthy vaginal microbiome maintains a naturally acidic pH between 3.8 and 4.5. Avoid internal douching or scented soaps; warm water on the external vulva preserves protective lactobacilli.</string>
    <string name="adult_topic2_title">UTI Prevention &amp; Hydration Protocol</string>
    <string name="adult_topic2_body">Always wipe front to back, urinate promptly after intimacy, wear breathable cotton underwear, and maintain consistent daily water intake to flush the urinary tract naturally.</string>
    <string name="adult_topic3_title">Cycle Hormones &amp; Emotional Intimacy</string>
    <string name="adult_topic3_body">Estrogen peaks near ovulation supporting natural energy and mood, while progesterone rises in the luteal phase encouraging rest and warmth. Understanding these shifts reduces stress and supports communication.</string>
    <string name="adult_topic4_title">Menstrual Cup &amp; Safe Product Usage</string>
    <string name="adult_topic4_body">Sterilize medical-grade silicone menstrual cups in boiling water for 5 minutes between cycles. Empty every 8 to 12 hours with clean hands to prevent irritation or infection.</string>

